<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Macronix Jan-Sept profit soars.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Macronix Jan-Sept profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macronix International Corp, one of Taiwan's leading semiconductor makers, said on Wednesday its pre-tax profit between January and September was T$2.4 billion, surging 89 percent from the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>Macronix's January-September combined sales totalled T$7.53 billion, up 35 percent from a year earlier, a company statement said.</p>
<p>In the month of September, the firm reported pre-tax profit of T$184 million on turnover of T$763 million.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
